{"id":"09b6b8442a4f4b4390a65190776752769eb73214","axis":"silent","repo":"payloadcms/payload","sha":"09b6b8442a4f4b4390a65190776752769eb73214","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/migration-guide/v4.mdx","lines":["@@ -911,6 +911,42 @@ If you only used `useDocumentInfo` for `title` / `setDocumentTitle`, drop the im"," "," Run `npx @payloadcms/codemod --transform migrate-document-title-context` to migrate automatically. The codemod splits mixed destructures, removes the `useDocumentInfo` import when no other properties are still used, and preserves any rename aliases (e.g. `{ title: docTitle }`)."," ","+### `Form` makes its own form-state requests","+","+`Form` owns server form-state requests after field changes and successful saves. Document forms derive their request information from the surrounding document and operation providers. Nested forms identify their schema with `schemaPath`; bulk forms restrict their fields with `select`, and widget forms identify their entity with `widgetSlug`.","+","+Remove callbacks that fetch and return server form state:","+","+```diff","+-const onChange = async ({ formState, submitted }) => {","+-  const { state } = await getFormState({","+-    collectionSlug,","+-    docPermissions,","+-    docPreferences: await getDocPreferences(),","+-    formState,","+-    operation: 'update',","+-    schemaPath,","+-    signal: controller.signal,","+-    skipValidation: !submitted,","+-  })","+-  return state","+-}","+-","+-<Form initialState={initialState} onChange={[onChange]}>","++<Form initialState={initialState} schemaPath={schemaPath}>","+```","+","+A document's main form uses `isDocumentForm` and does not need `schemaPath`. It also owns document locking, stale-data detection, permission refreshes and preview URLs. Pass persistent read-only state with `readOnly`; temporary `disabled` or processing state does not make fields read-only on the server.","+","+Plain custom forms without `isDocumentForm`, `schemaPath` or `widgetSlug` remain local, even when they receive `initialState` or are rendered inside a document provider. Initial state continues to be built before rendering the form.","+","+BREAKING CHANGES:","+","+- The return values of `onChange` and `onSuccess` are ignored. Use them for side effects only.","+- `onChange` receives the merged state after an edit refresh or local submit validation, including invalid validation results. Validation notifications have `submitted: true`.","+- Schema-backed forms with a local `onSubmit` validate on the server before committing. Remove `beforeSubmit` callbacks whose only purpose is fetching server form state. Invalid state or a validation request failure prevents the local commit.","+- After a successful save, `Form` refreshes permissions and state before calling `onSuccess`. Creates skip the state refresh because they replace the form. A failed refresh does not change the successful save outcome or suppress `onSuccess`.","+"," ### Locale hooks can now return null"," "," The return type of `useLocale` is now `Locale | null`. It returns `null` when localization is disabled or configured without any locales. In Payload 3, the hook was typed as `Locale` and returned an empty object when localization was unavailable."],"additions":36,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/richtext-lexical/src/features/blocks/client/component/index.tsx","lines":["@@ -1,5 +1,7 @@"," 'use client'"," ","+import type { FormProps } from '@payloadcms/ui'","+"," import { useLexicalComposerContext } from '@lexical/react/LexicalComposerContext'"," import { useLexicalEditable } from '@lexical/react/useLexicalEditable'"," import { getTranslation } from '@payloadcms/translations'","@@ -22,6 +24,7 @@ import {","   useDocumentInfo,","   useEditDepth,","   useFormSubmitted,","+  useOperation,","   useServerFunctions,","   useTranslation,","   XIcon,","@@ -103,7 +106,6 @@ export const BlockComponent: React.FC<BlockComponentProps> = (props) => {","   } = useEditorConfigContext()"," "," 